<testtitle>Read TaSCAN Data (C/C Main SW (Control CPU), C/C Main SW (Management CPU))</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), operate according to the screen display to display the "ECU Data Monitor" screen.</ptxt>
</test1>
